      "content": "omg help my eye stings so bad i just got some heavy duty drain cleaner splashed in it while cleaning the garage... everything is blurry and it feels like it's burning. should i try rubbing it really well with a cloth to get the liquid out or i have some homeopathic eye drops in my kit i could use??",
